                                    <span><strong class="text-white">6 attempts</strong> to crack the passcode</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-clock text-amber-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i>
                                    <span><strong class="text-white">30s</strong> trace window (Operative) / <strong class="text-white">20s</strong> (Mastermind)</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-rose-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-xs"></i>
                                    <span><strong class="text-rose-400">−3 sec penalty</strong> per wrong guess</span>
                                </li>
